# Local scratch notes. `*.md` used to be ignored wholesale, which quietly kept
# BUGS.md and the audit out of the repository — a blanket rule is why nobody
# noticed. Ignore the one personal file by name instead.
TASKS.md

# Parser run logs and JVM crash dumps land in the project root.
*.log
hs_err_pid*.log

# Abandoned Nuxt prototype on mock data — nothing builds or deploys it, and the
# real storefront is frontend/. Untracked rather than deleted so whoever wants
# anything out of it still can; safe to `rm -rf` once nobody does.
frontend-new/
